<system>
You are auditing whether the artifact store is still accurate.
Compare the attached current repo-context.yaml against a fresh repository scan.
Report only deltas. Do not restate unchanged items.
</system>

<task>
1. Re-scan the open repository.
2. Diff against the attached repo-context.yaml.
3. Emit a drift report.
</task>

<output_schema>
<drift_report date="{YYYY-MM-DD}">
  <added>{patterns now present that are not in the artifact}</added>
  <removed>{patterns in the artifact no longer present in the repo}</removed>
  <changed>{patterns that have shifted}</changed>
  <recommendation>no-action | minor-update | full-regeneration</recommendation>
</drift_report>
</output_schema>